: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">You will not take any action or make any representation that may confuse any consumer as to your relationship with Little Passports.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">You will get approval for any content and\/or third party testimonial to promote Little Passports.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">You will not post or serve links to Little Passports within any pop-up or pop-under windows, transitional or interstitial page ads, or layer ads.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">You will not attempt to intercept or redirect traffic to Little Passports.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">You will not artificially generate clicks or actions, whether by way of a robot, software program, or otherwise.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">You will not cloak, hide, spoof, or otherwise obscure the URL of your site or mobile platforms or those of any sub-affiliates such that we cannot reasonably determine the platform from which traffic originated.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">PAYMENT TERMS:<\/span><br>As a media partner in the Little Passports Performance Marketing Program, partners will be paid a referral fee for qualified sales. We reserve the right to adjust the referral fee payable to you for any reason, including, but not limited to, reporting errors, invalid or canceled orders, refunded orders, declined credit card, fraudulent customers, orders submitted by customers in countries, states, cities, counties, municipalities or zip codes where Little Passports does not ship, misattribution, or for business reasons. Additionally, we reserve the right to reverse any orders that were obtained through promotional methods that are a breach in this agreement.<\/p><\/di