ris Tweed, luxurious fleece, butter soft suede and crisp cotton weaves, plus a new range of Vegan Friendly options, all perfect for lounging, relaxing, working from home or getting outdoors.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We\u2019re committed to quality and it\u2019s what keeps our customers coming back.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">WHY JOIN THE BEDROOM ATHLETICS AFFILIATE PROGRAMME?<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>COMMISSION<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">You can earn up to 8% commission on all approved sales.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>CREATIVE<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Creative banners available to use right now.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Opportunity to request bespoke banners.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>COMMUNICATION<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular communication to Publishers.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Afilliate Marketing Team on hand to answer any questions.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 870.25px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Bedroom Athletics Affiliate Programme;<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Commision Rates -&nbsp;Competitive 8% (variable)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Product Feed available<\/li><li style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div>","url":"https:\/\/www.bedroomathletics.com\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=15652&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:15.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:46:35.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"bedroomathletics.com"}}  
