00e0 ces surplus de stock<\/span>&nbsp;en les&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">v\u00e9rifiant&nbsp;<\/span>et en s\u2019assurant de leur&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">qualit\u00e9&nbsp;<\/span>pour vous. Ces produits peuvent donc \u00eatre choisis par un acheteur une deuxi\u00e8me fois !<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Meilleur pour votre porte-monnaie (r\u00e9duction jusqu'\u00e0 -70% sur les marques premium), meilleur pour l'environnement !<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Meilleur pour votre porte-monnaie, meilleur pour l'environnement.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Email disclaimer:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sending commercial expressions through Awin is only allowed if the publisher is demonstrably compliant in accordance with Article 11.7 of the Telecommunications Act, the guidelines of the ACM and the Awin code of conduct for e-mail publishers.&nbsp;The Awin Code of Conduct must be signed and possession of Awin Benelux so this is transmissible on request by the ACM.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Previews are to be submitted for approval through the&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/translate.google.com\/translate?hl=nl&amp;prev=_t&amp;sl=nl&amp;tl=en&amp;u=http:\/\/toolbox.zanox.com\/email-approval\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">Email Approval Tool<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 When submitting a preview, the publisher indicates they agree to Article 11.7 of the Telecommunications Act and that the prior consent of all email recipients is obtained.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 The expression may only be sent if the advertiser has approved the preview.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 The publisher is responsible for any consequences imposed if they have been guilty of sending spam, or sending a commercial expression without permission of the advertiser.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.2echoix.fr\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=31151&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-04-03T19:01:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:26.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"2echoix.fr"}}  
