\">In 2022 alone the brand has seen great success in launching with Zalando into 4 markets: Germany, Netherlands, France and Belgium. Along with winning three Junior Design Awards for our Occasionwear, Boys' and Girls' clothing.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The brand continues to expand with our first international store in Bangalore, India launching in May 2022.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Find out more about Angel and Rocket and our affiliate program today by dropping us an email. We would love to hear from you.&nbsp;<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div id=\"container\" class=\"container-fluid\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: -40px; padding: 0px; min-height: 100%; height: auto !important;\"><section id=\"content\" style=\"margin: 20px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><div class=\"row row-widget\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px -10px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"col-md-9 col-lg-9 wrapper-widget\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 836.25px;\"><div class=\"profileTabContent widget padding-LR-null\" id=\"profileTabContent\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 25px; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 222, 222); display: inline-block; border-radius: 2px; width: 816.25px; position: relative;\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsTabContent\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10p