at little bit easier.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ninja positively impact people\u2019s lives every day in every home around the world.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Product Range:<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">-Ninja Foodi Multi Cookers<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">-Ninja Foodi Air Fryers &amp; Grills<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">-Ninja Food Processors<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">-Ninja Blenders &amp; Soup Makers<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A few great reasons to promote the Ninja program: -<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">3% commission paid to all affiliates<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">High stock levels&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">40 day validation period&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day cookie period&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Full datafeed available<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Full set of generic creatives<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">No leakage on affiliate traffic<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Affiliate tracking is present on all payment gateways<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">An average order value of \u00a3133.00<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Best se