engine networks is prohibited. Any site found to be using Pay Per Click advertising will be removed from the affiliate programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Cash back<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Websites offering cash back incentives are not permitted within our affiliate partnership.<\/p><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>","url":"https:\/\/us.rodial.com\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=20433&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T11:02:29.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"us.rodial.com"}}  
