ng: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>History of the brand<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Founded in 1999 by entrepreneur Maria Hatzistefanis who saw a gap in the market for high performance skincare offering targeted and immediate results&nbsp;to customers. Focusing on powerful active ingredients and creating tongue-in-cheek product names such as Dragon's Blood, Snake and Bee Venom,&nbsp;her brand instantly made waves in the beauty industry and quickly became firm favourites with A-listers worldwide, with fans such as Jourdan Dunn and Ellie Goulding.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Who is the Rodial customer?<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Rodial offers targeted skincare solutions for women aged 25 \u201355 with a core market aged 30 \u2013 40.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Rodial woman is confident, smart, dynamic and independent.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">She is affluent and fashion focused, appreciative of quality and style in equal measure.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">She is metropolitan, keeps up to date with the latest innovations in beauty\/fashion\/health\/tech and is willing to invest in premium products with guaranteed results.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">She has a desire to look and feel her best at any age.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>General Terms<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"