613957b8d4","f310a994-5efb-4ab2-9e21-323cc45d9813"],"valid_domains":["*.rodial.co.uk","www.rodial.co.uk","us.rodial.com","*.us.rodial.com"],"short_description":"Rodial is a hi-tech, innovative skincare and complexion brand. We create targeted products that deliver instant and long-lasting benefits.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Rodial US Affiliate Program<\/h4><p><div id=\"targetRegions\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/div><\/p><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Rodial - Luxury Skin Care - Body Care - Cosmetics<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">The ultimate skincare collection, Rodial offers targeted solutions with instant results and long-lasting benefits. Pairing world-class anti-ageing ingredients with ground-breaking innovation Rodial products are high-performance skincare essentials loved by beauty aficionados, celebrities and women in the know.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Revolutionary contouring make-up is a perfect complement to the bestselling Rodial sculpting skincare. A tightly edited range of luxury products sculpt and define the face for a flawless finish.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Affiliate Programme Benefits<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">***7% to 25% Commission Paid***<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">***Average basket total of $80***<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>History of the brand<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Founded in 1999 by entrepreneur Maria Hatzistefanis who saw a gap in the market for high performance skincare offering targeted and immediate results&nbsp;to customers. Focusing on powerful active ingredients and creating tongue-in-cheek product names such as Dragon's Blood, Snake and Bee Venom,&nbsp;her brand instantly made waves in the beauty industry and quickly became firm favourites with A-listers worldwide, with fans such as Jourdan Dunn and Ellie Goulding.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Who is the Rodial customer?<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Rodial offers targeted skincare solutions for women aged 25 \u201355 with a core market aged 30 \u2013 40.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Rodial woman is confident, smart, dynamic and independent.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">She is affluent and fashion focused, appreciative of quality and style in equal measure.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">She is metropolitan, keeps up to date with the latest innovations in beauty\/fashion\/health\/tech and is willing to invest in premium products with guaranteed results.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">She has a desire to look and feel her best at any age.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>General Terms<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please see specific terms relating to our affiliate relationship below. If you have any questions regarding the scope of the terms, please do not hesitate to contact us. Any affiliate that is found breaking our Terms and Conditions may have their commissions set to zero and risk being suspended from the programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Affiliate partnerships<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We reserve the right to discontinue an affiliate partnership without notice at any time.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Use of voucher codes<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You may only promote affiliate authorised voucher codes, these can be found on the \u2018discount vouchers\u2019 section on Affiliate Window.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is not permitted for affiliates to promote codes that are not issued via the affiliate channel. Any affiliate found to be promoting a non authorised code on their site will have the relevant transaction declined.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Rodial reserve the right to decline any sales that have been tracked with an unauthorised voucher code whether this code was promoted on the site or not.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>PPC advertising<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Pay Per Click advertising on any search engine and on the display or search engine networks is prohibited. Any site found to be using Pay Per Click advertising will be removed from the affiliate programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Cash back<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Websites offering cash back incentives are not permitted within our affiliate partnership.<\/p><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>","url":"https:\/\/us.rodial.com\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=20433&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T11:02:29.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"us.rodial.com"}}  
