px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular affiliate specific communication including deep links<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why customers choose Ninja: -<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Free Next Day Delivery across Mainland UK<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">12 month warranty on all Ninja products<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Individual product reviews&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Large selection of spares &amp; accessories<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular clearance, special offers and discounts<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">New products frequently added<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We place a great deal of importance in working closely with our affiliates. If you would like anything specific such as a custom graphic, to discuss any bespoke promotional opportunities or any aspect of the program then we\u2019d love to hear from you.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Join us now and start promoting today!<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Bloggers<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please&nbsp;ensure that you&nbsp;comply with the below guidelines from the Advertising Standards Authority.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.asa.org.uk\/uploads\/assets\/uploaded\/3af39c72-76e1-4a59-b2b47e81a034cd1d.pdf\"