an1 tdTextAlignCenter\" style=\"float: none; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 44px; padding: 8px; line-height: 20px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\"><img class=\"imageHeight\" src=\"https:\/\/merchant.linksynergy.com\/fs\/cli\/en\/\/images\/common\/red_x.png\" style=\"height: 18px; max-width: 100%; border: 0px;\"><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><table class=\"table\" style=\"max-width: 100%; background-color: transparent; border-spacing: 0px; width: 1038.02px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><caption class=\"pull-left\" style=\"float: left;\"><h5 style=\"margin: 10px 0px; font-family: inherit; line-height: 20px; color: inherit; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: 14px;\">List of prohibited keywords:<\/h5><\/caption><tbody><tr class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 1035.8px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-left: 0px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-collapse: separate; border-radius: 4px;\"><td style=\"padding: 8px; line-height: 20px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\"This policy prohibits the Affiliate from Bidding on Allen Edmonds\u2019s domain name\",\"\u201cAllenEdmonds.com\u201d\",\"and any keyword string or display URL that includes this term. Specifically\",\"the Affiliate may not use the domain name as the display URL in any means to falsely promote themselves as the official site. Purchasing domain names based on Allen Edmonds\u2019s trademarks or variations is also a violation of Allen Edmonds\u2019s trademark. Affiliate can purchase search engine keywords or domain names that use Allen Edmonds\u2019s trademark \u201cAllen Edmonds\u201d only if contained in the descriptive Ad Copy and does not insinuate that they are the official site.\