le=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">And\u2026<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Vanities for Custom Placements<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">30-Day Cookie<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">AOV: $57<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In-House Affiliate Management<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>About NOOD:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">NOOD is more than a brand.It is a movement to normalize breast education and empower women through information. Our solutionwear is designed to be inclusive of size and skin tone, kind to your skin and kind to the planet.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Inclusivity and innovation is at the heart of what we do here at NOOD.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We design innovative and inclusive solutionwear that empower women of all sizes and skin tones to wear the clothes they want.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As a 100% women founded and owned company, we are dreamers and hope to inspire other woman to believe in themselves. Our work is only just beginnning. Our product expansion will ensure that women everywhere will get glammed up in NOOD.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>About the affiliate program<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The NOOD affiliate program&nbsp;is a great opportunity to promote products that are sustainable and empower women by entrenching body confidence.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">NOOD is pleased to accept international sales.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">NOOD has extensive coverage on Youtube, Instagram, and Facebook and amazing brand awareness<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">For questions, please contact lauren.barturen@advertisepurple.com.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We do not allow search marketing, paid search marketing or trademark plus bidding with any of the terms listed in the sections below.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">NOOD, NOOD.co.uk, NOOD coupon, NOOD coupon code, NOOD.co.uk coupon, NOOD.co.uk coupon code, NOOD promo code, NOOD.co.uk promo code, NOOD.co.uk promotional code, NOOD promotional code and any variations including misspellings, alternate spellings, alternate spacing, or any phrases that include these terms.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/lovenood.co.uk\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=26577&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-29T19:00:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:48:18.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"lovenood.co.uk"}}  
