\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">You are not permitted to use misspellings, or upper\/lower case variants of the above.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Landing Pages<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">All clicks must first land on Your site, and the user must click from Your site to the Required URL in order for there to be a Qualifying Link.<\/li><\/ul><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Clicks must never land directly on the Required URLs.<\/li><\/ul><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Overlays and masked URLs are not permitted.<\/li><\/ul>","url":"https:\/\/www.thebodyshop.com\/en-gb\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=7899&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-05-11T19:00:09.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T11:23:48.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"thebodyshop.com"}}  
