style: none;\">Free shipping on all orders above $60<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day returns<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Orders generated with student discount codes may not be commissionable<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Terms and Conditions<\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">*Lovisa operate strict paid search Ts&amp;Cs and reserve the right to suspend affiliates that do not follow the program terms*<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Linking Methods and Creatives<\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Lovisa provide a variety of linking methods, including banners and a product data feed. It is recommended that affiliates take links directly from the linking methods section of their account.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Affiliates may not alter any of the creative or text links available through the Affiliate Window interface. Affiliates are also requested not to hardcode banners into their sites, so that any creative updates take immediate effect.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A product data feed is provided with the most accurate pricing available everyday through the Affiliate Window interface. Affiliates are requested to make every effort to maintain the most current pricing information in their promotions.<\/li><\/ul><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Use of Voucher Codes<\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Affiliates may only promote codes that are provided through the Lovisa affiliate programme.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Lovisa reserve the right to decline commissions and withhold payment of commissions if non-authorised voucher codes are used in an affiliate sale without prior consent from Lovisa.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Where voucher codes are issued with an expiry date this should be clearly displayed, and codes should be removed or explicitly marked as expired after this date unless you are advised otherwise.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Any affiliates displaying expired codes without marking them as being expired may be suspended from the programme.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Please not that cashback and a voucher code&nbsp;cannot be used in conjunction with each other and sales will be declined unless otherwise stated&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission Rates<\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Standard Flat Commission Rate: 6%&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Social Content Creators<\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note if you wish to use affiliate links within your&nbsp;Instagram Stories and other social channels, you will&nbsp;need to use #ad as the only valid identifier to be ASA compliant. Awin&nbsp;has a&nbsp;one-page website&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/emea01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpaidforadvertising.co.uk%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7C%7Cab26d5b9843d4663d2f608d601d4e64f%7C5a9ab2d37b5845259851d1727266bad7%7C0%7C0%7C636698411229030022&amp;sdata=Dx95BlFzX0PLs%2FAOo4x80