nd our Account Manager at Rakuten (<a href=\"mailto:ra-eurocamp@mail.rakuten.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ra-eurocamp@mail.rakuten.com<\/a>).<br><br>Have a look around our&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.eurocamp.co.uk\/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\">website<\/a>&nbsp;to really get to know us and feel free to get in touch with any questions.<br><strong><br>ABOUT US<\/strong><br><br>We\u2019re not just a holiday company...<br><br>We've spent over 45 years helping families create holidays that redefine quality time. Here's how we do it:<br><ol style=\"text-align: left;\"><li>We offer the biggest choice of outdoor holidays across Europe with over 175 specially selected parcs, so no matter what you\u2019re perfect holiday looks like we\u2019ll have a destination to match<\/li><li>Experience the kind of accommodation that can't be found anywhere else, from Safari and Classic Tents, to modern Holiday Homes<\/li><li>Leave fixed arrival and departure dates behind; it's about travel and timings that suit you<\/li><li>It's your holiday, not ours, so we won't tell you what to do, but we can show you the possibilities<\/li><li>On parc activities ranging from canoeing to horse riding. We also offer free, age-specific kids\u2019 clubs, with bespoke activities like zorbing and hover boarding.<\/li><\/ol><strong><br>PROGRAM DETAILS<\/strong><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li>Attractive basic commission of&nbsp;<strong>4% on every consumed booking<\/strong><\/li><li>We use a&nbsp;<strong>28 day cookie-window<\/strong><\/li><li>High AOV ranges between&nbsp;<strong>\u00a3900 and \u00a31200<\/strong><\/li><li>Full range of creative available<\/li><li>Programme of incentives including free holiday giveaways and increased commissions.<\/li><li>Special offer notifications and monthly newsletters to keep you up to date on the latest.<\/li><\/ul><strong><br>TERMS 