prepare an account statement. No need to search for your payment card ever again: A simple and streamlined checkout is available to all Business Account customers.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Sign up here:&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.zoro.co.uk\/info\/zoro-business-account\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.zoro.co.uk\/info\/zoro-business-account<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Zoro Quotations:<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Zoro Quotations are quick and easy to create. Click the Add to Quotation button on any product page. You can then choose to create a new quotation or add the product to an existing one. Once created, quotations can easily be emailed, printed, and forwarded on. They can later be retrieved, updated, and turned into an order with just a few clicks.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">The key-feature of Zoro quotations is that they will lock the very best price for that product for 14 days.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">You do not need to create a Zoro account to create, manage or retrieve a quote.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Find o