&nbsp;<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.zoro.co.uk\/info\/business-accounts-quotations\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.zoro.co.uk\/info\/business-accounts-quotations<\/a><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Tiered Pricing:<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">The more you spend, the more you save, with our Tiered Pricing Programme! If in any 30-day period your spend takes you over the threshold of the next pricing level, you will receive the higher discount for the next 60 days.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Maintain that spend within these 60 days and you will continue to enjoy this better pricing. That way, the more you spend, the more you save.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Multi User Accounts:<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Multi-user accounts allow you to consolidate all your company purchases.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Once you have invited your colleagues to join, they will be able to make quick and easy purchases under your Zoro Business Account.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">As an admin, you can add, remove or alter others privileges, set the spend limits of colleagues and view all business account invoices all in one place.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Program summary:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Variable commission of 2.5, 5% - 7.5% commission depending on affiliate type.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day cookie period&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Product data feed with over 500,000 skus<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">No commission paid on canceled or returned orders<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">No commission paid to voucher code affiliates who use out of date, invalid or non affiliate discount codes.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Search Campaign:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Protected SEM Bidding Keywords:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">zoro, zoro.co.uk, zoro tools, zoro.com, zoro voucher, zoro tools voucher, zoro tools discount, zoro discount