a3613957b8d4","f310a994-5efb-4ab2-9e21-323cc45d9813"],"valid_domains":["www.zoro.co.uk"],"short_description":"Zoro is one of the worlds leading Industrial Supply companies, Zoro's extensive range of over 3.5 million products includes everything from power tools and chemicals to personal protective equipment, from all the leading brands.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Zoro UK Affiliate Program<\/h4><p><div id=\"targetRegions\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/div><\/p><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Zoro offers over 500,000 Industrial supply products from all the leading brands. These products are separated into 28 different categories all filled with competitively priced Items.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Zoro Business Accounts:<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Zoro Business Accounts are free and make shopping on Zoro even easier by providing your business with a credit line and 30 days End of Month payment terms.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Order everything your business needs, any time you want, and pay before the end of the following month. At the beginning of each month Zoro will prepare an account statement. No need to search for your payment card ever again: A simple and streamlined checkout is available to all Business Account customers.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Sign up here:&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.zoro.co.uk\/info\/zoro-business-account\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.zoro.co.uk\/info\/zoro-business-account<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Zoro Quotations:<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Zoro Quotations are quick and easy to create. Click the Add to Quotation button on any product page. You can then choose to create a new quotation or add the product to an existing one. Once created, quotations can easily be emailed, printed, and forwarded on. They can later be retrieved, updated, and turned into an order with just a few clicks.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">The key-feature of Zoro quotations is that they will lock the very best price for that product for 14 days.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">You do not need to create a Zoro account to create, manage or retrieve a quote.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Find out more here:<span>&nbsp;<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.zoro.co.uk\/info\/business-accounts-quotations\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.zoro.co.uk\/info\/business-accounts-quotations<\/a><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Tiered Pricing:<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">The more you spend, the more you save, with our Tiered Pricing Programme! If in any 30-day period your spend takes you over the threshold of the next pricing level, you will receive the higher discount for the next 60 days.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Maintain that spend within these 60 days and you will continue to enjoy this better pricing. That way, the more you spend, the more you save.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Multi User Accounts:<\/b><\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Multi-user accounts allow you to consolidate all your company purchases.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">Once you have invited your colleagues to join, they will be able to make quick and easy purchases under your Zoro Business Account.<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px;\">As an admin, you can add, remove or alter others privileges, set the spend limits of colleagues and view all business account invoices all in one place.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Program summary:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Variable commission of 2.5, 5% - 7.5% commission depending on affiliate type.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day cookie period&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Product data feed with over 500,000 skus<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">No commission paid on canceled or returned orders<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">No commission paid to voucher code affiliates who use out of date, invalid or non affiliate discount codes.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Search Campaign:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Protected SEM Bidding Keywords:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">zoro, zoro.co.uk, zoro tools, zoro.com, zoro voucher, zoro tools voucher, zoro tools discount, zoro discoun