27add63-b8f5-471d-be5a-a3613957b8d4","f310a994-5efb-4ab2-9e21-323cc45d9813"],"valid_domains":["*.lovisa.com"],"short_description":"We are a fashion-forward jewellery brand that caters to every woman, with 150 new styles being delivered to stores each week. We give exceptional customer service and apply our core belief to everything we do: It\u2019s about her always.","description":"<h2 class=\"margin-top-sm\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Lovisa AU Affiliate Program<\/h2><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You are invited to promote Lovisa on Awin!<\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Lovisa was created out of a need for on-trend fashion jewellery at ready-to-wear prices. Our trend spotting departments worldwide take inspiration from couture runways and current street style to deliver new, must-have styles to our customers.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are a fashion-forward jewellery brand that caters to every woman, with 150 new styles being delivered to stores each week.&nbsp;We give exceptional customer service and apply our core belief,&nbsp;It\u2019s about her, always&nbsp;to everything we do.<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Program Benefits include:<\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">8% commission dependant on publisher category<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day conversion window<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Banner creative supplied<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Free shipping on all orders above $60<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day returns<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Orders generated with student discount codes may not be commissionable<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Terms and Conditions<\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">*Lovisa operate strict paid search Ts&amp;Cs and reserve the right to suspend affiliates that do not follow the program terms*<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Linking Methods and Creatives<\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Lovisa provide a variety of linking methods, including banners and a product data feed. It is recommended that affiliates take links directly from the linking methods section of their account.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Affiliates may not alter any of the creative or text links available through the Affiliate Window interface. Affiliates are also requested not to hardcode banners into their sites, so that any creative updates take immediate effect.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A product data feed is provided with the most accurate pricing available everyday through the Affiliate Window interface. Affiliates are requested to make every effort to maintain the most current pricing information in their promotions.<\/li><\/ul><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Use of Voucher Codes<\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Affiliates may only promote codes that are provided through the Lovisa affiliate programme.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Lovisa reserve the right to decline commissions and withhold payment of commissions if non-authorised voucher codes are used in an affiliate sale without prior consent from Lovisa.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Where voucher codes are issued with an expiry date this should be clearly displayed, and codes should be removed or explicitly marked as expired after this date unless you are advised otherwise.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Any affiliates displaying expired codes without marking them as being expired may be suspended from the programme.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Please not that cashback and a voucher code&nbsp;cannot be used in conjunction with each other and sales will be declined unless otherwise stated&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission Rates<\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Standard Flat Commission Rate: 6%&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Social Content Creators<\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note if you wish to use affiliate links within your&nbsp;Instagram Stories and other social channels, you will&nbsp;need to use #ad as the only valid identifier to be ASA compliant. Awin&nbsp;has a&nbsp;one-page website&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/emea01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpaidforadvertising.co.uk%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7C%7Cab26d5b9843d4663d2f608d601d4e64f%7C5a9ab2d37b5845259851d1727266bad7%7C0%7C0%7C636698411229030022&amp;sdata=Dx95BlFzX0PLs%2FAOo4x80oq69S55T3GjhjWeCDZUvn0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">Paid for Advertising<\/a>&nbsp;- which&nbsp;explains&nbsp;how free content can have a commercial relationship attached to it.&nbsp;This can be linked to by any affiliate in order&nbsp;to make your readers aware of how affiliate links work. If&nbsp;you have any questions on this please speak to your account contact.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates will not disclose any confidential information as outlined in the Awin terms and conditions. This is inclusive of trading plans, messaging and promotions which should not be distributed or advertised until go live date.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">https:\/\/www.awin.com\/gb\/terms-and-conditions\/publisher-terms-and-conditions-2017<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.lovisa.com.au","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=18726&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:46:25.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"lovisa.com.au"}}  
