st.<\/li><\/ul><strong><br>TERMS AND CONDITIONS<\/strong><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li>Please take note that Eurocamp will not accept any sales from traffic generated using paid search on the terms \u201cEurocamp\u201d and any misspellings. If affiliates are running any PPC campaigns, then they must not use Eurocamp in their display URL as part of their ads.<\/li><li>Publishers must not register or use a URL containing Eurocamp, misspells or derivatives in the domain name (e.g.&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.eurocampparks.net\/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\">eurocampparks.net<\/a>) without express permission.<\/li><li>Publishers must not use the brand name, misspells or derivatives in the sub domains (<a href=\"http:\/\/www.eurocamp.yourdomain.co.uk\/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\">eurocamp.yourdomain.co.uk<\/a>) without express permission.<\/li><li>Publishers are permitted to use the brand name in sub folders (e.g. www.yourdomain.co.uk\/eurocamp).<\/li><li>Past employees of Eurocamp, Holidaybreak or Greenbank Holidays must have written permission to participate in the affiliate programme.<\/li><li>Commission is only payable on UK Eurocamp bookings and will only be paid once the customer has actually departed for their holiday. Bookings for Eurocamp Independent are not eligible for commission.<\/li><li>Transaction Queries: Please note that sales are validated on consumption, that is after the holiday is taken. Therefore, unless untracked and invalid we are unable to fully validate transaction queries until after the holiday has been taken.<\/li><li>Exclusive codes: Affiliates may not use discount codes unless permission has been given to the affiliate. Eurocamp has the right to decline commission from any bookings made using an unauthorised discount code.<\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/td><\/tr><tr>