ken from another source.<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;Buy Sheds Direct<\/span>&nbsp;will provide all codes suitable for affiliate use via email, the Awin&nbsp;News Manager, the Offers Blog or via their affiliate manager. If an affiliate uses a code not issued for affiliate use, then commissions will be declined. Buy Sheds Direct reserves the right to withdraw a voucher code or stop any promotional activity at any time.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Validation of Sales where a Voucher Code has been used<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Buy Sheds Direct reserve the right to decline any sales that have been tracked with an unauthorised voucher code whether this code was promoted on the site or not.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Domain Restrictions<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may not use any domain owned by Buy Sheds Direct for PPC linking without express written permission.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates are asked not to register domains which are similar or misspellings of Buy Sheds Direct brand. Any activity of this kind on the campaign will result in commissions being declined.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The use of the domain Buy Sheds Direct and variations is strictly forbidden in any ad copy including display URL, and the use of the term \u2018official site\u2019 in your ad copy is forbidden.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates wishing to promote Buy Sheds Direct through search engine marketing via a landing page should first contact the account management team to discuss this.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Creatives<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may not alter any of the creative or text links available through the Affiliate Window interface. Affiliates are also requested not to hardcode banners into their sites, so updates made to those available through Affiliate Window may take immediate effect.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Validations<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Buy Sheds Direct reserve the right to reject any transactions they deem to be illegitimate, fraudulent or otherwise non-valid.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Delivery<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Most of our products are available for delivery to all areas of mainland UK. We do not ship internationally.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.buyshedsdirect.co.uk\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=25446&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:00.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:42.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"buyshedsdirect.co.uk"}}  
