-ab0e-9855a2713450","8ae99f6d-d390-420c-b738-5699955ba938","c61eae9e-56c1-4024-855f-a457d692a42f","d27add63-b8f5-471d-be5a-a3613957b8d4","f310a994-5efb-4ab2-9e21-323cc45d9813"],"valid_domains":["angelandrocket.com","*.angelandrocket.com"],"short_description":"At Angel  Rocket we are inspired by kids personalities, quirky individuality and their innate sense of style. We pride ourselves on attention to detail and uncompromised passion for design and quality. Buy Better. Wear Longer. Hand down.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Angel and Rocket Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Angel and Rocket is a family-run business launched in 2014. Founder Kate previously had a history in the fashion world, with leading roles within large retailers including Next, Asda and Marks &amp; Spencer. Through her love of fashion and experience, she went on to form her own brand Angel and Rocket.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Designed in the UK with a flag store in Buckinghamshire, and made in ethical factories globally every detail is considered and offered to customers at affordable prices.&nbsp; Unique and Stylist collections are offered to our customers aged 0- 14 years using premium fabrics, fair-trade organic cotton and recycled polyesters.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Angel and Rocket believe being different is cool and strive to produce a collection which enhances character,&nbsp; personality, happiness and joy.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In 2022 alone the brand has seen great success in launching with Zalando into 4 markets: Germany, Netherlands, France and Belgium. Along with winning three Junior Design Awards for our Occasionwear, Boys' and Girls' clothing.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The brand continues to expand with our first international store in Bangalore, India launching in May 2022.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Find out more about Angel and Rocket and our affiliate program today by dropping us an email. We would love to hear from you.&nbsp;<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div id=\"container\" class=\"container-fluid\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: -40px; padding: 0px; min-height: 100%; height: auto !important;\"><section id=\"content\" style=\"margin: 20px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><div class=\"row row-widget\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px -10px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"col-md-9 col-lg-9 wrapper-widget\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 836.25px;\"><div class=\"profileTabContent widget padding-LR-null\" id=\"profileTabContent\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 25px; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 222, 222); display: inline-block; border-radius: 2px; width: 816.25px; position: relative;\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsTabContent\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>TERMS AND CONDITIONS<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In consideration of the promises set forth below, each party agrees as follows:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>1. Offers and Engagements.<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.1. From time to time, we may post on the Network offers (each, an \"Offer\") to pay to other participants a specified commission in return for certain advertising services leading to a Qualifying Link (defined below). &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.2. If You accept one of our Offers, we will have entered into an \"Engagement.\" &nbsp;Each Engagement shall have the same identification number as the original Offer that lead to the Engagement and shall be governed by the terms and conditions of this Agreement. &nbsp;However, in the event of any inconsistency between the terms of the specific Engagement and the terms of this Agreement, the terms of the Engagement shall govern.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.3. At any time prior to You displaying a Qualifying Link on one of Your websites, Advertiser may, with or without notice (a) change, suspend or discontinue any aspect of an Offer or an Engagement or (b) remove, alter, or modify any graphic or banner ad that we have submitted for an Offer or an Engagement. &nbsp;You agree to promptly implement any request from Us to remove, alter or modify any such graphic or banner ad.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.4. Voucher codes cannot be advertised unless authorised by Angel and Rocket, if unauthorised codes are advertised commission payments for any sales generated during the period the code was advertised will be cancelled. If unauthorised codes are repeatedly advertised the affiliate may be removed from the network.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.5. Cashback is not eligible when a voucher code has been used<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.6. Members should only use voucher codes listed on Cashback sites. If you use voucher codes or gift vouchers that are not listed on Cashback sites your cashback may not track or be declined.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>2. Your Responsibilities.<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">2.1. You hereby agree to comply with all applicable laws.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">2.2 You hereby agree that the position, prominence and nature of links on your site shall comply with any requirements specified in the Engagement, but otherwise will be in Your discretion.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">2.3. You agree not to make any representations, warranties or other statements concerning Us, Our site, any of Our products or services, or Our site policies, except as expressly authorised by the Engagement.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">2.4. You are responsible for notifying Us and Awin Limited of any malfunctioning of the URLs specified in the Engagement (the \"Required URLs\") or other problems with Your participation in the Engagement. &nbsp;We will respond promptly to all concerns upon receipt of Your notification.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>3. Commissions.<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.1. We agree to pay to You the commission specified in the Engagement if We sell to a visitor to Our site (a \"Customer\") a product or service that is the subject of the Engagement and if that Customer has accessed Our site and purchased the product or service via a Qualifying Link.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.2. A \"Qualifying Link\" is a link from Your site to Our site using one of the Required URLs or any other URL provided by Us for use in the Awin UK Network if it is the last link to Our site that the Customer uses during a Session where a sale of a product or a service to Customer occurs. &nbsp;A \"Session\" is the period of time beginning from a Customer's initial contact with Our site via a link from Your site and terminating when the Customer either returns to Our site via a link from a site other than Your site or the Engagement expires or is terminated.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.3. We shall have the sole right and responsibility for processing all orders made by Customers. You acknowledge that all agreements relating to sales to Customers shall be between Us and the Customer.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.4. All determinations of Qualifying Links and whether a commission is payable will be made by Awin Limited and will be final and binding on both You and Us. &nbsp;Prices for the products will be set solely by us in Our discretion.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.5. We will not pay commission on products which are subsequently returned to Angel and Rocket.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.6. We are unable to pay commission on products exchanged after