ng page should first contact the account management team to discuss this.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Creatives<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may not alter any of the creative or text links available through the Affiliate Window interface. Affiliates are also requested not to hardcode banners into their sites, so updates made to those available through Affiliate Window may take immediate effect.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Validations<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Buy Sheds Direct reserve the right to reject any transactions they deem to be illegitimate, fraudulent or otherwise non-valid.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Delivery<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Most of our products are available for delivery to all areas of mainland UK. We do not ship internationally.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.buyshedsdirect.co.uk\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=25446&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:00.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:42.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"buyshedsdirect.co.uk"}}  
