b0e-9855a2713450","8ae99f6d-d390-420c-b738-5699955ba938","c61eae9e-56c1-4024-855f-a457d692a42f","d27add63-b8f5-471d-be5a-a3613957b8d4","f310a994-5efb-4ab2-9e21-323cc45d9813"],"valid_domains":["angelandrocket.com","*.angelandrocket.com"],"short_description":"At Angel  Rocket we are inspired by kids personalities, quirky individuality and their innate sense of style. We pride ourselves on attention to detail and uncompromised passion for design and quality. Buy Better. Wear Longer. Hand down.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Angel and Rocket Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Angel and Rocket is a family-run business launched in 2014. Founder Kate previously had a history in the fashion world, with leading roles within large retailers including Next, Asda and Marks &amp; Spencer. Through her love of fashion and experience, she went on to form her own brand Angel and Rocket.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Designed in the UK with a flag store in Buckinghamshire, and made in ethical factories globally every detail is considered and offered to customers at affordable prices.&nbsp; Unique and Stylist collections are offered to our customers aged 0- 14 years using premium fabrics, fair-trade organic cotton and recycled polyesters.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Angel and Rocket believe being different is cool and strive to produce a collection which enhances character,&nbsp; personality, happiness and joy.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In 2022 alone the brand has seen great success in launching with Zalando into 4 markets: Germany, Netherlands, France and Belgium. Along with winning three Junior Design Awards for our Occasionwear, Boys' and Girls' clothing.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The brand continues to expand with our first international store in Bangalore, India launching in May 2022.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Find out more about Angel and Rocket and our affiliate program today by dropping us an email. We would love to hear from you.&nbsp;<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div id=\"container\" class=\"container-fluid\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: -40px; padding: 0px; min-height: 100%; height: auto !important;\"><section id=\"content\" style=\"margin: 20px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><div class=\"row row-widget\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px -10px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"col-md-9 col-lg-9 wrapper-widget\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 836.25px;\"><div class=\"profileTabContent widget padding-LR-null\" id=\"profileTabContent\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 25px; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 222, 222); display: inline-block; border-radius: 2px; width: 816.25px; position: relative;\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsTabContent\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\