7b8d4","f310a994-5efb-4ab2-9e21-323cc45d9813","8ae99f6d-d390-420c-b738-5699955ba938","5f2ce3f8-a7c5-4939-ab0e-9855a2713450"],"valid_domains":["tower-london.com","*.tower-london.com"],"short_description":"TOWER is London\u2019s fastest growing independent footwear retailer, found at the heart of our capital\u2019s engaging community. Our reputation spans two locations, boasting more than 40 years as a team bursting with creative ideas.","description":"<h2 class=\"margin-top-sm\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Tower London UK Affiliate Program<\/h2><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Founded in 1980 as a supplier of all things footwear, we are TOWER London.\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">To keep it brief, TOWER is an indie retailer situated at the centre of London's growing and engaging footwear community, playing host to five locations spread across the capital. We sport a\u202fnoteworthy reputation spanning 40 years as a team bursting with creative ideas and credible heritage, a feat accomplished whilst supporting\u202four local area in aid of charitable causes. \u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Beyond a physical presence, our vast online store allows us to reach outside of London and tap into multiple locations, whilst we run affiliate activity in the UK, DE and FR. So, if you have a site that covers other regions then please get in touch to discuss cross market opportunities.\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are known for stocking a carefully curated edit of footwear brands representing both on-trend styles and particular favourites city-wide \u2013 simply put, we are as diverse as you are, a one-stop-shop per se. Our brands include Dr. Martens, Veja, Birkenstock, New Balance, Barbour, Kickers, Armani, Hugo Boss and many more listed&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.tower-london.com\/brands\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\"><u style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">here.<\/u><\/a>\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Welcome to the TOWER London affiliate programme.<\/span>\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As an affiliate of TOWER London, we look to offer all our partners an attractive range of opportunities to work with us going forwards. These opportunities include:\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A competitive base commission rate starting at 3% ranging upwards,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Flexible rates across key brands, enabling us to work with you to incentivise different campaigns,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The opportunity to activate content partnerships with commission on influence and unique collaborations,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">An optimised product feed updated daily,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Regularly updated banners and exclusive marketing material,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A proven team of contacts ready to offer personal support, built from our plethora of in-house experts,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A generous 30 day cookie window,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Weekly newsletter distribution, \u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">New stock hitting the site weekly alongside regular restocks of our best sellers,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Free delivery over \u00a360 on all orders and free returns.\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are open to working with affiliates of all forms and levels, however, it is vital that any partnerships enable us to collaborate transparently with our partners when promoting or\u202foptimising our key brands. Please read our terms and conditions for full details and if you have a great idea as to how we can work together, providing the TOWER London criteria is met please email&nbsp;<i style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">affiliates@tower-london.com.&nbsp;<\/span><\/i>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Welcome to the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">TOWER London affiliate programme<\/span>. As a&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">TOWER affiliate<\/span>, we ask that you read our&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">T&amp;C\u2019s carefully<\/span>. If you have any doubts on how to promote, please contact:&nbsp;<i style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">affiliates@tower-london.com.<\/span><\/i><i style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/i><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">General Promotions<\/span>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Please only promote current offers and pricing as provided by TOWER London. Any information linked to TOWER London must be correct. Regular miscommunication of pricing and offers will result in being removed from the programme.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Commission<\/span>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">TOWER London\u2019s default commission rate starts at 3% ranging upwards and is dependant on publisher type, which can vary by promotional method type. We do not authorise commission on orders purchased with pre-purchased gift cards. Whilst we are open to all partner types it must be completely clear as to how TOWER London must be promoted - you as the affiliate must be able to provide this as requested. See publisher types below:&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Content - 8%,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Influencer - 8%,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">CSS\/Shopping - 8%,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Closed user group - 5%,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Loyalty - 5%,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Voucher - 3%,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Cashback - 3%,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Technology - 3%,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Subnetwork - 3%.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;In the event of technical disruption leading to untracked sales or commission, TOWER London would not be liable for this loss. We do not include VAT and shipping when calculating commission costs.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Exclusive Promotions and Voucher codes<\/span>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">TOWER-london.com reserves the right to add, amend, withdraw\u202fpromotions as used by individual\u202faffiliates at any given time without the necessity to provide valid reason.\u202fWe ask that you promote voucher codes intended for the affiliate channel provided, supplied by TOWER London\u2019s affiliate team. Promoting voucher codes that are not intended for the affiliate channel may result in declined commissions.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Branding<\/span>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">When referencing TOWER-london.com, we ask that you use the most current logo as seen on the network profile. For asset resizing queries, contact: affiliates@tower-london.com&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Contact<\/span>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">For overarching enquiries, email TOWER London affiliate team:\u202faffiliates@tower-london.com,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">For all other press enquiries, email TOWER London Press Office on affiliates@tower-london.com.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Marking your Work with our Brand as Advertising.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">In becoming a representative for the TOWER London brand, it becomes your role to promote any codes by regulations that apply to affiliate marketing.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Any aspect of activity as part of promoting the TOWER-london.com Affiliate programme must be marked as paid advertising as clearly as possible, using such labels as \u201c#Ad\u201d, \u201cAD\u201d or \u201cAdvertisement Feature\u201d after or before captions or in-image copy. Should this not be upheld, you will be removed from the programme.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Any paid content in promotion of TOWER London must be approved by affiliates@tower-london.com, including copy, video, emails and creative.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">PPC &amp; Landing Pages<\/span>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">We do not allow brand bidding as standard on our programmes, we may occasionally work with a partner on a campaign basis but this activity must be pre-agreed and only run for the duration of the campaign. This activity will not be allowed on pure brand terms. Any partner found bidding on brand terms or brand plus voucher terms outside of an agreed activity with be issued a warning, shou