div><div class=\"labelValue io_diff_line\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 26px; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; display: table-cell;\">Reversal of performance advertising actions are decided by the Advertiser governed by a max reversal percentage of 100%<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"labelLine\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: table; width: 1071px;\"><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: table-row;\"><div class=\"labelCell heading2text\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; display: table-cell; width: 200px;\">Media Partner Tracking Pixel<\/div><div class=\"labelValue io_diff_line\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 26px; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; display: table-cell;\">Advertiser does NOT allow media partner to fire their tracking pixel when the consumer action is completed.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"labelLine\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: table; width: 1071px;\"><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: table-row;\"><div class=\"labelCell heading2text\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; display: table-cell; width: 200px;\">Australia Custom Terms<\/div><div class=\"labelValue io_diff_line\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 26px; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; display: table-cell;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">KitchenAid Australia Custom Terms<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">It is a condition of entering this agreement that PARTNER (\u201cyou\u201d, \u201cyour\u201d, \u201cyourselves\u201d) agree to the below terms. KitchenAid (\u201cus\u201d, \u201cwe\u201d \u201cour\u201d) reserves the right to reverse any sales generated outside of these terms:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 15px 0px 30px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Payout Rate<\/span>&nbsp;- Payout rate may vary based on the advertiser and publisher agreement.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Payout Terms<\/span>&nbsp;- Commission will not be paid on Untracked Orders. Commission will not be paid if the order has been cancelled or recognised as a fraudulent transaction.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">PARTNER&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">must get prior approval from KitchenAid<\/span>&nbsp;to create and use own images<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">PARTNER&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">cannot bid on our brand names (including but not limited to KitchenAid or KitchenAid Australia)<\/span>&nbsp;or use our Brand name in your search engine marketing campaigns.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">PARTNER&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">must get prior approval from KitchenAid to syndicate creative banners to related PARTNER networks<\/span>, websites or programmatic ad campaigns.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">PARTNER&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">cannot use bots<\/span>&nbsp;to generate fake clicks\/traffic.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">or PARTNER<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;cannot pay for traffic<\/span>&nbsp;(eyeballs clicks) to visit&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/kayosports.com.au\/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"outline: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(2, 95, 162);\">KitchenAid.com.au<\/a>&nbsp;from a 3rd party, especially sources that are based outside of AU.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">PARTNER&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">cannot create social media<\/span>&nbsp;(including but not limited to Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, YouTube and Snapchat). accounts\/pages\/profiles\/channels, groups, events, posts, comments or paid ads, pretending to be our brand in an effort to market yourselves as our brand.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">PARTNER should request permission before promoting KitchenAid&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">via email or any means other than as agreed in this EIO<\/span>.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Last Click Attribution&nbsp;<\/span>- Tracked conversions are de-duped on a last click basis against other marketing channels, for e.g. search, email advertising, display advertising, direct partnerships, price comparison, etc.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Additional activities&nbsp;<\/span>\u2013 from time to time, PARTNER and KitchenAid Australia may agree to engage in additional media or marketing activities, including but not limited to direct displays (such as EDMs), media placements and sponsored editorial (\u201cAdditional Activities\u201d). Payment for these Additional Activities may be through Impact or as otherwise agreed by the parties. If the parties engage in any Additional Activities, these Custom Terms shall apply.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Marketing and Promotional Plan<\/span>&nbsp;\u2013 PARTNER will use best endeavours to maximise the publicity of KitchenAid and any Additional Activities, which may be conducted in accordance with a marketing and promotional plan to be agreed between the parties.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Staff purchases<\/span>&nbsp;- Staff Promo Codes are non-commissionable. Any sales using a staff promo code will be cancelled and commissions reversed.<\/li><\/ol><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>","url":"http:\/\/kitchenaid.com.au\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/kitchenaid-australia.pxf.io\/c\/4101692\/719433\/10789","type":"api","created_at":"2023-04-17T05:12:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T11:44:57.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"kitchenaid.com.au"}}  
