com"],"short_description":"En HP Inc., creemos en la reinvenci\u00f3n. Creemos que la tecnolog\u00eda debe mejorar la vida de todos en todas partes. At HP Inc., we believe in reinvention. We believe that technology should make life better for everyone everywhere.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">HP CO Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">El programa<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;de afiliados de HP<\/span>&nbsp;est\u00e1 evolucionando para aprovechar los cambios del mercado y las necesidades de los ecosistemas pareja. El nuevo programa, disponible exclusivamente en Awin, est\u00e1 dise\u00f1ado para impulsar el crecimiento, el desarrollo de nuevos negocios, y para alinearse con las prioridades estrat\u00e9gicas. Sin dejar de centrarse en la conducci\u00f3n del negocio de volumen en las categor\u00edas principales (PC, impresi\u00f3n, suministros), tambi\u00e9n estamos aumentando el foco en el desarrollo del crecimiento en los nuevos, soluciones y servicios.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\"HP opera a una f\u00f3rmula muy simple:. La fuerza del canal es igual a la salud de HP Estamos muy entusiasmados con las nuevas oportunidades de negocio por delante y estamos comprometidos con nuestra sociedad mutuamente pr\u00f3spera.\" - Jefe Weisler Dion delegado de HP.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">En HP Inc., creemos en la reinvenci\u00f3n. Creemos que la tecnolog\u00eda debe mejorar la vida de todos en todas partes. Esta visi\u00f3n gu\u00eda todo lo que hacemos, c\u00f3mo lo hacemos y por qu\u00e9 lo hacemos.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Es por eso que mantenemos reinventar nuestra compa\u00f1\u00eda, nuestras tecnolog\u00edas, y lo que depara el ma\u00f1ana, de modo industrias, las comunidades y los individuos pueden seguir reinventando la forma en que operan, idear y crear lo que m\u00e1s importa a ellos.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\"Reinventar\" es nuestro sistema operativo. Es la idea de la forma en que actuamos, pensamos y sentimos, y detr\u00e1s del mundo que creemos. Cada d\u00eda, nos ayudan a conformar este nuevo mundo con el coraz\u00f3n, la creatividad y la energ\u00eda de un inicio, y con el cerebro, los m\u00fasculos, y la determinaci\u00f3n de una compa\u00f1\u00eda Fortune 100.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Nuestro objetivo es la excelencia mediante la colaboraci\u00f3n y creemos que al mezclar los mejores y los m\u00e1s brillantes talentos, enriquecido con diversos antecedentes y perspectivas de todas las tendencias, podemos tener \u00e9xito en la comprensi\u00f3n de lo que m\u00e1s importa a nuestros clientes y para cada individuo en la sociedad.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 promover HP<\/span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">?<\/span><\/b><\/p><table style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Categoria<\/span><\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Comisi\u00f3n CPA<\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Accesorios<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7,50%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Suplementos &amp; Otros<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7,50%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Monitores<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7,50%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Impresoras<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Desktops<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3,75%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\">Laptops<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\">3,75%<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">7 d\u00edas de cookie<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Atribuci\u00f3n: Sesi\u00f3n, directo y organico.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">alimentaci\u00f3n del producto<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">promociones regulares<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The HP Affiliate Program<\/span>&nbsp;is evolving to take advantage of market changes and partner ecosystem needs. The new program, available exclusively on Awin,&nbsp;is designed to drive growth, develop new business, and to align with strategic priorities. While continuing to focus on driving volume business in the core categories (PC, Print, Supplies), we are also increasing focus on delivering growth in the new, solutions and services.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\"HP operates to a very simple formula: the strength of the channel equals the health of HP. We are excited about the new business opportunities ahead and are committed to our mutually prosperous partnership.\" - Dion Weisler Chief Executive Officer, HP<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">At HP Inc., we believe in&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">reinvention<\/span>. We believe that technology should make life better for everyone everywhere. This vision guides everything we do, how we do it, and why we do it.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is why we keep reinventing our company, our technologies, and what tomorrow holds\u2014so industries, communities, and individuals can keep reinventing how they operate, ideate, and create what matters the most to them.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\"Keep Reinventing\" is our operating system.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is the idea behind the way we act, think, and feel, and behind the world we believe in.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Every single day, we help shape this new world with the heart, creativity, and energy of a startup, and with the brain, muscles, and determination of a Fortune 100 company.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We aim for excellence through collaboration and believe that by melding the best and the brightest talent, enriched by diverse backgrounds and perspectives of every stripe, we can succeed in understanding what matters the most to our customers and to every individual across society.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Categories:&nbsp;<\/span>computers, laptops, electronics, printers, computer accessories<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why Promote HP?<\/b><\/span><\/p><table style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Category<\/span><\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission CPA<\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Accesorios<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7,50%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Supplies<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7,50%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Monitores<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7,50%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Printers<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Desktops<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3,75%<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\">Laptops<\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\">3,75%<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; mar