iption":"Cassvensi\u2122 provides classy and unique menopause bedding. We make sure women who suffer from hot flushes at night sweats because of menopause don\u2019t have to compromise their quality of life.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Cassvensi Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Reasons to promote Cassvensi products:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Founded by a certified Menopause Wellness Coach, Cassvensi\u00ae started with a mission to ensure women in&nbsp;menopause who suffer from night sweats, hot flushes and mood swings don\u2019t compromise their quality of life&nbsp;by enabling them to start the new day&nbsp;fresh, calm, and confident.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cassvensi\u00ae have developed&nbsp;bedding with care&nbsp;to re-empower active, performance-minded women to reclaim their days by&nbsp;ensuring a cool, dry and comfortable night\u2019s sleep.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are the only brand in the UK that sells 600 thread count 100% Tencel Lyocell bed sheets, ethically made in Portugal, and developed specifically for women who suffer from menopausal symptoms.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Tencel\u00ae is an award-winning super fabric, developed by the Austrian company Lenzing.&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.researchgate.net\/profile\/Mohammad-Abu-Rous\/publication\/237548338_THE_FUNCTIONAL_PROPERTIES_OF_TENCELR_-_A_CURRENT_UPDATE\/links\/5a8c2cddaca272017e654bfb\/THE-FUNCTIONAL-PROPERTIES-OF-TENCELR-A-CURRENT-UPDATE.pdf\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">Research<\/a>&nbsp;found that Tencel bedding:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">makes you feel cooler at night<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">has superior moisture management properties<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">reduces sweating at night<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">improves sleep quality<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Tencel is hypoallergenic, antibacterial, silky soft (and gets softer with every wash), OEKO-tex certified (no harmful chemicals are sued), and most importantly - sustainable.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">At Cassvensi\u00ae, we use modern medical research to perfectly understand the beneficial properties of plants, minerals, and vitamins known for centuries to be effective at alleviating menopause symptoms. Then we employ 21st-century science to blend the best of them into clinically proven supplements with high-quality, natural and active ingredients, specially created to target the most frequent and fatiguing side effects of menopause.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Our two supplements are:<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Made in the UK<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">GMP &amp; GHP certified&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Non-GMO<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">100% Vegan<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Fortified by ethically grown and sustainably sourced ingredients<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">100% Free from Hormones, Sugar, Soy, Lactose, Artificial Colouring &amp; Flavours.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Safe to take with HRT*<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Free from E Numbers<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">* &nbsp;We recommend to speak with your healthcare provider before your start taking any supplements.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Growth:&nbsp;<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Cassvensi was bootstrapped and launched in the UK in January 2023. Our target audience is women suffering from menopausal hot flashes, night sweats and mood swings (predominantly age 45-55). Roughly 13 million people in the UK are currently menopausal or in the perimenopausal stage, which is equal to one-third of the country\u2019s female population (up to 80% of women experience hot flashes or night sweats) \u2013 it\u2019s a large and evergreen market.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our current product range includes exclusive to us 600 thread count 100% Tencel Lyocell bed linen, made in Portugal, in white and navy blue colour (to fit UK bed size king, super king, emperor). Two supplements, made in the UK: Fenomeno Hot Flush Tamer to help alleviate hot flushes and night sweats; and Fenomeno Anxiety Antidote to help alleviate the feeling of anxiety, stress, irritability and mood swings.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In the future, we\u2019re planning to expand our product range to 100% Tencel: duvet, weighted blankets and pyjamas.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Join Cassvensi as we get ready to become the number 1, premium, sustainable menopause sleep brand and feel good in the knowledge that you are supporting products that truly make a difference and add value to women\u2019s everyday life without harming the environment &nbsp;(Tencel is a sustainable fabric and we only use recyclable packaging).&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Join us for...<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Generous commission plus regular sale events and discounts to boost sales.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A sustainable brand that adds value to women\u2019s everyday life and improves their quality of life.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Regular updates to the program with news and latest offers by email.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Dynamically updated feeds to keep you constantly up to date.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Reactive account manager to assist with all of your queries.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our Products:<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>We offer premium products. Our current product range includes exclusive to us 600 thread count 100% Tencel bed linen in white and navy blue colour (to fit UK bed size king, super king, emperor), made in Portugal. Two supplements, made in the UK: Fenomeno Hot Flush Tamer to help alleviate hot flushes and night sweats; and Fenomeno Anxiety Antidote to help alleviate the feeling of anxiety, stress, irritability and mood swings.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">AOV<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Average order value of \u00a3250<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cookie Length<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Cookie length of 30 days.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Delivery<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>FREE UK Delivery On All Orders<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Returns<\/b><\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">60 day return<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission Rates<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Competitive commission structure.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Goods returned within the 60 day returns period will not receive a commission payment.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A commission is paid excluding VAT and P&amp;P on the final transaction amount after all discounts have been applied.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cassvensi is happy to consider offering private commissions and rewards for the right level of exposure. If you feel this is of interest please contact us.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">CONTACT US:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Dominika Dragulska<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">dominika@dimanca.com<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>AFFILIATE PROGRAM TERMS AND CONDITIONS<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">By applying to and joining the Cassvensi.net affiliate program or accessing an affiliate link from a third party or other partner within the Cassvensi.net affiliate program, you agree to the following rules, regulations, and terms and conditions.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Use of Trademarks<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We do not allow the use of our trademarks, URLs, misspellings, extensions or any variation within the goal of optimizing for them. Below are guidelines to follow:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>PPC and Media Buys&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You may NOT bid or use any of our trademarks, names, extensions or variations as keywords for any PPC network, content network or media buy. Please also add \"cassvensi\", and \u201ccass vensi\u201d, to your negative keywords list.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We may ask for screenshots if we see your ads showing our trademarks or brands, and you agree to provide them within 2 business days. During this time frame your commissions may be set to zero and some or all may be reversed regardless of origin. If we can verify sales were not driven using our trademarks, your commissions will be restored.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-ri