 Edmonds\u201d only if contained in the descriptive Ad Copy and does not insinuate that they are the official site.\"<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><table class=\"table\" style=\"max-width: 100%; background-color: transparent; border-spacing: 0px; width: 1038.02px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><caption class=\"pull-left\" style=\"float: left;\"><h5 style=\"margin: 10px 0px; font-family: inherit; line-height: 20px; color: inherit; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: 14px;\">List of allowed keywords:<\/h5><\/caption><tbody><tr class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 1035.8px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-left: 0px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-collapse: separate; border-radius: 4px;\"><td style=\"padding: 8px; line-height: 20px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\"Affiliate may purchase keywords\",\"Pay Per Click advertising\",\"AdWords\",\"search terms\",\"or other identifying terms that include the use of \u201cAllen Edmonds\u201d on any search engine\",\"portal\",\"sponsored advertising service or other search or referral service. If Allen Edmonds determines\",\"in its sole discretion\",\"that Affiliate has purchased or attempted to purchase \u201cAllen Edmonds\u201d keywords or domain names in violation of the cited examples above\",\"then Allen Edmonds may (without limiting any other remedies available to it) pursue any or all of the following actions: 1. Withhold all compensation otherwise payable to Affiliate beginning with the date on which Affiliate purchased the prohibited trademarked terms\",\"2. Remove Affiliate from the Allen Edmonds affiliate Program permanently\",\"and\/or 3. Contact the search engine in which Affiliate ad was found to ask that these ads be removed immediately and permanently.\"<\/td><\/tr><\/tb