-5699955ba938","5f2ce3f8-a7c5-4939-ab0e-9855a2713450"],"valid_domains":["busforfun.com","*.busforfun.com"],"short_description":"BusForFun \u00e8 una mobility company specializzata nel trasporto di persone verso grandi eventi nazionali ed internazionali e verso location ad alto richiamo di visitatori, mediante autobus a basse emissioni","description":"<h2 class=\"margin-top-sm\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Busforfun IT Affiliate Programme<\/h2><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">NON verranno riconosciute commissioni sulla vendita di&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">soli tickets&nbsp;<\/span>(tutti i prodotti presenti nella landing&nbsp;page &nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/eur01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.busforfun.com%2Fbiglietti-prossimi-eventi&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cmarco.altomare%40awin.com%7Cc59791568b914cbbc0b508db4d63cc41%7C5a9ab2d37b5845259851d1727266bad7%7C0%7C0%7C638188863274263949%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=emCh6k5k8qQFHrobYwb1nfL9kPhfXZwR%2BgGyAYg2zWQ%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.busforfun.com\/biglietti-prossimi-eventi<\/a>) e sui&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">viaggi<\/span>&nbsp;(Immaturi e Notte prima degli esami). Maggiori dettagli nei T&amp;C.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Le commissioni delle transazioni vengono approvate ad evento confermato - Possono trascorre anche dei mesi prima della convalida della transazione se essa fa riferimento ad un evento che si svolger\u00e0 tra diversi mesi -&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">CHI SIAMO&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">BusForFun \u00e8 una mobility company specializzata nel trasporto di persone verso grandi eventi nazionali ed internazionali (concerti, festival, fiere) e verso location ad alto richiamo di visitatori (parchi divertimento, localit\u00e0 sciistiche e balneari), mediante autobus a basse emissioni.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Grazie ad un potente motore di ricerca, abbinato ad una business intelligence e ad un sistema di prenotazione rapido e sicuro, BusForFun offre un servizio di trasporto comodo, affidabile e sicuro, alle migliori tariffe possibili.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Nel corso degli anni BusForFun ha costruito una rete di oltre 3.000 punti vendita affiliati e consolidato una serie di prestigiose collaborazioni con organizzatori di eventi (fiere, festival, concerti) e location fortemente attrattive (es. Gardaland, Misano World Circuit).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Grazie a queste collaborazioni, oltre al servizio di trasporto, in molti casi BusForFun offre anche la possibilit\u00e0 di acquistare prodotti aggiuntivi (es. ticket di ingresso, esperienze) ovvero pacchetti comprensivi di viaggio ed esperienza (es. Bus + Skipass, Bus + Ingresso).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">BusForFun ha una diffusione capillare su tutto il territorio nazionale, con una rete di oltre 800 fermate e punta alla leadership a livello europeo, essendo gi\u00e0 presente in Austria, Svizzera, Slovenia e Spagna.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Perch\u00e9 aderire al programma d\u2019affiliazione di BusForFun.com?<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Offre le migliori tariffe di mercato<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Brand reputation eccezionale (<a href=\"https:\/\/it.trustpilot.com\/review\/busforfun.com\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">recensioni<\/a>)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Esperienza ventennale nel settore dei trasporti<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Presenza capillare su tutto il territorio nazionale (https:\/\/www.busforfun.com\/fermate)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Ampia variet\u00e0 di prodotti&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Frequenti promozioni ed incentivi<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">CONCERTI<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Raggiungere il tuo evento preferito non \u00e8 mai stato cos\u00ec comodo, semplice e divertente.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Un paio di clic su BusForFun e guidare nel traffico, cercare parcheggio per ore, individuare le \u201cimprobabili\u201d coincidenze tra mezzi pubblici o trovare un posto dove passare la notte, saranno soltanto brutti ricordi!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.busforfun.com\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\"><u style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Scopri i prossimi viaggi<\/u><\/a>&nbsp;e salta a bordo!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Transaction fees are approved at confirmed event - It can also take months before the validation of the transaction if it refers to an event that will take place in several months -&nbsp;<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">ABOUT US:<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">BusForFun is a mobility company specialized in the transportation of people to major national and international events (concerts, festivals, fairs) and to locations with high visitor appeal (amusement parks, ski resorts and beaches) by low emission buses.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Thanks to a powerful search engine, combined with business intelligence and a fast and secure booking system, BusForFun offers a convenient, reliable and safe transport service at the best possible rates.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Over the years BusForFun has built a network of over 3,000 affiliated stores and consolidated a series of prestigious collaborations with event organizers (fairs, festivals, concerts) and highly attractive locations (e.g. Gardaland, Misano World Circuit).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Thanks to these collaborations, in addition to the transport service, in many cases BusForFun offers the possibility to purchase additional products (e.g. entrance tickets, experiences) or packages including travel and experience (e.g. Bus + Skipass, Bus + Entrance).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">BusForFun is widely present throughout the country, with a network of over 800 stops and aims for leadership at the European level, being already present in Austria, Switzerland, Slovenia and Spain.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Why join the BusForFun.com affiliate program?<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Offers the best market rates<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Outstanding brand reputation (<a href=\"https:\/\/it.trustpilot.com\/review\/busforfun.com\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\"><u style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">reviews<\/u><\/a>)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Twenty years of experience in the transport sector<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Widespread presence throughout the country (https:\/\/\/www.busforfun.com\/stops)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Wide variety of products&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Frequent promotions and incentives<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">CONCERTS<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Reaching your favorite event has never been so convenient, simple and fun.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A couple of clicks on BusForFun and driving in traffic, looking for parking for hours, spotting the \"unlikely\" connections between public transport or finding a place to spend the night, will be just bad memories!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.busforfun.com\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\"><u style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Discover the next trips and jump on board<\/u><\/a>!<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney