casion. Nous rachetons des livres et CD d'occasions aupr\u00e8s des biblioth\u00e8ques,entreprises, collectivit\u00e9s et particuliers, contribuant \u00e0 l'\u00e9conomie circulaire tout en soutenant des causes caritatives.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Ammareal FR Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Fond\u00e9e en 2013, Ammareal.fr est une entreprise engag\u00e9e dans l'\u00e9conomie circulaire avec une mission pr\u00e9cise : rendre la culture accessible \u00e0 tous en proposant des livres d'occasion \u00e0 des prix tr\u00e8s abordables.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ses activit\u00e9s impliquent le rachat de livres et Cd d'occasion aupr\u00e8s de biblioth\u00e8ques, entreprises, collectivit\u00e9s, librairies et particuliers, contribuant ainsi \u00e0 la long\u00e9vit\u00e9 des livres et \u00e0 leur 'immortalit\u00e9'. En pratiquant des prix bas, Ammareal favorise la diffusion culturelle \u00e0 tous les niveaux de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Mais l'engagement d'Ammareal va au-del\u00e0. Il s'agit d'une entreprise solidaire qui emploie de nombreuses personnes en contrats aid\u00e9s, faisant d'elle une actrice importante de l'inclusion sociale. De plus, une part de ses b\u00e9n\u00e9fices est consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 des causes caritatives, ce qui t\u00e9moigne de son engagement altruiste.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Fid\u00e8le \u00e0 ses principes d'\u00e9conomie sociale et solidaire, Ammareal a \u00e9t\u00e9 distingu\u00e9e par le label&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">ESUS&nbsp;<\/span>(Entreprise Solidaire d'Utilit\u00e9 Sociale). Ce label reconna\u00eet les entreprises qui allient rentabilit\u00e9 \u00e9conomique et impact social positif.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">En somme, Ammareal est une entreprise qui se d\u00e9marque par son approche \u00e9thique et responsable, contribuant \u00e0 la fois \u00e0 la diffusion de la culture, \u00e0 l'inclusion sociale et \u00e0 la durabilit\u00e9 environnementale.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Ammareal en quelques chiffres<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;1 000 000 de r\u00e9f\u00e9rences litt\u00e9raires et musicales d'occasion<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;25 000 nouveaut\u00e9s par semaine<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;Une croissance \u00e0 deux chiffres chaque ann\u00e9e&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Un service client \u00e0 la pointe du e-commerce (4.8\/5\u2b50)<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>\u00catre affili\u00e9 Ammareal c'est :<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Un tracking avec les cookies jusqu'\u00e0 30 jours post click<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Des ressources graphiques mises \u00e0 votre disposition<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Un taux de transformation attractif et - de 1% de taux de retour ou annulation<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Une r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration dynamique&nbsp;<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">En devenant affili\u00e9, vous soutiendrez non seulement l'\u00e9conomie circulaire en prolongeant la vie des livres, mais vous contribuerez \u00e9galement \u00e0 notre mission de rendre la culture accessible \u00e0 tous gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 nos prix attractifs.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Rejoindre notre programme d'affiliation est un moyen simple et efficace de participer \u00e0 un mouvement plus grand que nous tous. Ensemble, nous pouvons faire une diff\u00e9rence, soutenir l'inclusion sociale, promouvoir l'\u00e9ducation et aider \u00e0 pr\u00e9server notre plan\u00e8te.&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Rejoignez-nous aujourd'hui !<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>[ENGLISH VERSION]<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Founded in 2013, Ammareal.fr is a company committed to the circular economy with a specific mission: to make culture accessible to everyone by offering second-hand books at very affordable prices.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Its activities involve buying back used books from libraries, businesses, and other sources, thus contributing to the longevity of books and their 'immortality'. By practicing low prices, Ammareal promotes cultural dissemination at all levels of society.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">But Ammareal's commitment goes beyond. It is a solidarity company that employs many people under assisted contracts, making it an important player in social inclusion. In addition, a portion of its profits is dedicated to charitable causes, attesting to its altruistic commitment.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">True to its principles of social and solidarity economy, Ammareal has been distinguished by the ESUS (Social Utility Solidarity Company) label. This label recognizes companies that combine economic profitability with a positive social impact.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In short, Ammareal is a company that stands out for its ethical and responsible approach, contributing to the dissemination of culture, social inclusion, and environmental sustainability.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Ammareal in a few figures:<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">1,000,000 literary and musical references second-hand&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">25,000 novelties per week&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Double-digit growth each year&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Cutting-edge e-commerce customer service (4.8\/5\u2b50)<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Being an Ammareal affiliate means:<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Tracking with cookies up to 30 days post click&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Graphic resources made available to you&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">An attractive conversion rate and less than 1% return or cancellation rate&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Dynamic remuneration<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">By becoming an affiliate, you will not only support the circular economy by extending the life of books, but you will also contribute to our mission to make culture accessible to everyone thanks to our attractive prices.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Joining our affiliate program is a simple and effective way to participate in a movement bigger than all of us. Together, we can make a difference, support social inclusion, promote education, and help preserve our planet.&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Join us today!<\/span><\/p><\/div>","program_policies":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.ammareal.fr\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=44907&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-05-23T19:01:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:29.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"ammareal.fr"}}  
